{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_214_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_214","textTraditional":"一、二年。春王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_214_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_214","textTraditional":"二、夏五月壬辰，雉門及兩觀災。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_214_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_214","textTraditional":"其言雉門及兩觀災何？兩觀微也。然則曷為不言雉門災及兩觀？主災者兩觀也。時災者兩觀，則曷為後言之？不以微及大也。何以書？記災也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_214_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_214","textTraditional":"三、秋，楚人伐吳。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_214_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_214","textTraditional":"四、冬十月，新作雉門及兩觀。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_214_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_214","textTraditional":"其言新作之何？脩大也。脩舊不書，此何以書？譏。何譏爾？不務乎公室也。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}